{"file": "D:\\SpaceBook\\_cls7_jpg\\geo\\066.jpg", "lines": [{"text": "5.7MainEffectsofClimateChange", "conf": 0.943, "box": [[49, 92], [440, 98], [439, 125], [49, 118]]}, {"text": "What affects our environment in your opinion?The effects of climate change are numerous.", "conf": 0.899, "box": [[50, 140], [762, 147], [761, 170], [50, 164]]}, {"text": "Some of them are desertification, rising sea levels, melting of ice and glaciers, recurrent", "conf": 0.939, "box": [[80, 170], [805, 177], [805, 203], [80, 196]]}, {"text": "occurring offloods anddroughts.", "conf": 0.875, "box": [[83, 195], [346, 198], [346, 220], [83, 216]]}, {"text": "Rising sea level poses a serious threat to farmland, housing, recreation areas and most", "conf": 0.922, "box": [[81, 223], [804, 232], [804, 258], [81, 250]]}, {"text": "importantlycoastal lifearoundtheworld.", "conf": 0.928, "box": [[84, 250], [414, 254], [413, 275], [84, 271]]}, {"text": "The weather patterns are changing; the winters are getting shorter and the summers longer.", "conf": 0.903, "box": [[80, 279], [800, 288], [800, 313], [80, 303]]}, {"text": "Climate change leads to the extinction of plant and animal species. The flowers and fruits", "conf": 0.923, "box": [[81, 308], [800, 319], [800, 343], [81, 333]]}, {"text": "are blooming earlier.The birds aremoving to cold climates for survival.Coral reefs as well", "conf": 0.914, "box": [[82, 333], [801, 343], [801, 366], [82, 356]]}, {"text": "assealifeisunderseverethreat.", "conf": 0.929, "box": [[83, 356], [346, 362], [346, 382], [83, 376]]}, {"text": "Theextremeweatherconditions,like heatwavesand storms,whichwerenotveryfrequent", "conf": 0.924, "box": [[81, 385], [801, 398], [801, 421], [81, 408]]}, {"text": "in the recent past, are becoming more and more common.", "conf": 0.881, "box": [[81, 409], [538, 417], [538, 440], [81, 433]]}, {"text": "The ocean's current patterns are also changing due to climate change.", "conf": 0.904, "box": [[80, 438], [628, 449], [628, 473],